1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:00,975
广告花一千美元
$1,000 spent on advertising.

2
00:00:00,990 --> 00:00:03,195
竟然带来了五千美元的销售额
It brought in $5,000 in sales.

3
00:00:03,210 --> 00:00:04,335
老板高兴坏了
The owner is delighted.

4
00:00:04,350 --> 00:00:06,160
这广告太划算了
What a great deal!

5
00:00:06,270 --> 00:00:08,140
但等等真的赚钱吗
But wait. Is it really profitable?

6
00:00:08,310 --> 00:00:10,275
今天我们讲一个商业概念
Here is a business concept:

7
00:00:10,290 --> 00:00:11,200
ROAS
ROAS

8
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:13,540
广告支出回报率
Return on Ad Spend

9
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:14,595
简单来说
Simply put:

10
00:00:14,610 --> 00:00:16,215
每花一美元广告费
For every $1 spent on ads,

11
00:00:16,230 --> 00:00:18,280
能带来多少美元销售额
how many dollars of sales follow?

12
00:00:18,630 --> 00:00:20,380
以下数据全是假设
All figures are hypothetical.

13
00:00:20,610 --> 00:00:22,780
一家小企业卖美容产品
A small business sells beauty products.

14
00:00:22,950 --> 00:00:24,640
广告花了一千美元
It spends $1,000 on ads

15
00:00:24,690 --> 00:00:26,655
带来了五千美元销售额
and generates $5,000 in sales.

16
00:00:26,670 --> 00:00:28,420
ROAS等于五
ROAS equals 5.

17
00:00:28,530 --> 00:00:30,100
看起来非常漂亮
That looks impressive.

18
00:00:30,270 --> 00:00:32,260
但产品也有成本
But products have costs too.

19
00:00:32,550 --> 00:00:34,875
假设产品和订单变动成本
Product and order variable costs

20
00:00:34,890 --> 00:00:36,880
占销售额的百分之七十
are assumed to be 70% of sales.

21
00:00:37,050 --> 00:00:38,415
五千美元销售额
From $5,000 in sales,

22
00:00:38,430 --> 00:00:40,420
扣掉三千五百美元成本
subtract $3,500 in variable costs.

23
00:00:40,470 --> 00:00:42,255
只剩下一千五百美元
Only $1,500 remains.

24
00:00:42,270 --> 00:00:44,295
再扣掉一千美元广告费
Subtract $1,000 in ad spend.

25
00:00:44,310 --> 00:00:46,180
最后只剩下五百美元
Only $500 remains.

26
00:00:46,530 --> 00:00:47,955
五千美元的销售额
$5,000 in sales,

27
00:00:47,970 --> 00:00:50,560
广告带来的贡献竟然只有五百美元
but just $500 in after-ad contribution!

28
00:00:50,970 --> 00:00:52,575
如果这次广告只带来
What if the ads brought in

29
00:00:52,590 --> 00:00:54,340
三千美元的销售额呢
only $3,000 in sales?

30
00:00:54,390 --> 00:00:56,595
扣掉百分之七十的变动成本
Subtract 70% in variable costs.

31
00:00:56,610 --> 00:00:58,180
只剩下九百美元
Only $900 remains.

32
00:00:58,230 --> 00:00:59,740
连广告费都不够
Not even enough to cover the ads.

33
00:00:59,970 --> 00:01:01,695
所以ROAS高
So a high ROAS

34
00:01:01,710 --> 00:01:03,820
不一定代表广告真的赚钱
does not guarantee profitable ads.

35
00:01:04,230 --> 00:01:07,240
老板不能只看广告带来多少销售额
Owners must look beyond ad-driven sales.

36
00:01:07,290 --> 00:01:09,880
还要看产品成本和广告费用
Include product costs and ad spend.

37
00:01:10,110 --> 00:01:12,015
记住销售额告诉你
Remember: sales tell you

38
00:01:12,030 --> 00:01:13,720
广告带来多少生意
how much business the ads brought.

39
00:01:13,890 --> 00:01:16,095
广告后的贡献才告诉你
After-ad contribution tells you

40
00:01:16,110 --> 00:01:18,100
这笔投资是不是值得
whether the investment is worth it.

41
00:01:18,210 --> 00:01:20,140
这就是数据看生意
This is Business Through Data.
